  displayName: Griffin
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84f6ff2532c6e3c4f95738d2a78bb45a, type: 3}
  description: "A griffin is a large hybrid beast, combining a lion\u2019s body with
    an eagle\u2019s head and a powerful tail. It has two wings, broad and feathered,
    and moves at a strong pace on the ground, stalking like a big cat before taking
    off. It makes only animalistic cries - screams, barks, and harsh eagle-shrieks."
